{
  "description": "Read-only evidence review for a virtual PLC safety trip. The local PLC interlock remains the immediate safety authority. Missing telemetry is a fail-closed branch; no Datadog actuator command. Trip and ACK gauges are aggregate signals; do not treat them as a same-command or incident match without Mongo evidence.",
  "published": true,
  "sensitivePrivileges": false,
  "tags": [
    "env:demo",
    "evidence:required",
    "maturity:level5-design",
    "plan:workflow-01",
    "project:smiot",
    "safety:fail-closed",
    "safety:read-only",
    "service:smiot-smart-farm"
  ],
  "name": "SMIOT | W1 | Verify PLC safety trip evidence",
  "spec": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 96,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "errorHandlers": [
          {
            "fallbackStepName": "escalate_query_failed",
            "retryStrategy": {
              "linear": {
                "interval": "1s",
                "maxRetries": 1
              },
              "kind": "RETRY_STRATEGY_LINEAR"
            }
          }
        ],
        "name": "read_operational_signals",
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.dd.metrics.queryScalarData",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "main",
            "nextStepName": "verify_evidence_available"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "10m",
            "name": "range"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "safety_trip",
                "query": "sum:smiot.virtual_plc.safety_trip{event:safety_trip}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              },
              {
                "aggregator": "last",
                "name": "safety_ack",
                "query": "sum:smiot.virtual_plc.safety_ack{event:safety_ack}",
                "data_source": "metrics"
              }
            ],
            "name": "queries"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "formula": "safety_trip"
              },
              {
                "formula": "safety_ack"
              }
            ],
            "name": "formulas"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "verify_evidence_available",
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.if",
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 216
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "joinOperator",
            "value": "and"
          },
          {
            "name": "conditions",
            "value": [
              {
                "comparisonOperator": "eq",
                "leftValue": "${ (() => { const c=Steps.read_operational_signals.data?.attributes?.columns || []; const names=[\"safety_trip\", \"safety_ack\"]; return names.every(k => { const v=Number(c.find(x=>x.name===k)?.values?.[0]); return Number.isFinite(v); }); })() }",
                "rightValue": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "true",
            "nextStepName": "classify_evidence"
          },
          {
            "branchName": "false",
            "nextStepName": "escalate_missing_evidence"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 384
          }
        },
        "name": "classify_evidence",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "nextStepName": "evidence_observed",
            "branchName": "true"
          },
          {
            "nextStepName": "escalate_or_review",
            "branchName": "false"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "and",
            "name": "joinOperator"
          },
          {
            "value": [
              {
                "comparisonOperator": "eq",
                "leftValue": "${ (() => { const c=Steps.read_operational_signals.data?.attributes?.columns || []; const trip=Number(c.find(x=>x.name===\"safety_trip\")?.values?.[0]); const ack=Number(c.find(x=>x.name===\"safety_ack\")?.values?.[0]); return Number.isFinite(trip) && Number.isFinite(ack) && trip>0 && ack>0; })() }",
                "rightValue": true
              }
            ],
            "name": "conditions"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.if"
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 552,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "evidence_observed",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "W1 | TRIP_AND_ACK_AGGREGATE_SIGNALS_PRESENT | Aggregate trip and safe-stop ACK metrics are both non-zero, but the workflow cannot correlate them to one command or incident. Match the exact scenario_run_id/command_id in Mongo incident_telemetry_evidence and action_ledger before confirming this case. No actuator command was sent by Datadog; this is not recovery proof.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "main",
            "nextStepName": "notify_smiot_app"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 552,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "escalate_or_review",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "W1 | TRIP_OR_ACK_NOT_CONFIRMED | At least one aggregate trip/ACK signal is zero. Do not infer the local PLC state from this aggregate query. Check exact command_id, incident evidence and local interlock; no Datadog actuator action.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "main",
            "nextStepName": "notify_smiot_app"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "y": 552,
            "x": 0
          }
        },
        "name": "escalate_query_failed",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "value": "SMIOT | W1 | Verify PLC safety trip evidence | DECISION=UNKNOWN | EVIDENCE=QUERY_ERROR | ACTION=NONE | NEXT=OPERATOR | Evidence unavailable; fail closed and hand to an operator. No actuator or infrastructure action.",
            "name": "value"
          }
        ],
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo",
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "main",
            "nextStepName": "notify_smiot_app"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "escalate_missing_evidence",
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.core.echo",
        "display": {
          "bounds": {
            "x": 384,
            "y": 552
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "value",
            "value": "W1 | DECISION=UNKNOWN | EVIDENCE=required metric column missing or non-numeric | ACTION=NONE | NEXT=operator checks telemetry source and monitor window; do not mark recovered"
          }
        ],
        "outboundEdges": [
          {
            "branchName": "main",
            "nextStepName": "notify_smiot_app"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "notify_smiot_app",
        "actionId": "com.datadoghq.http.request",
        "connectionLabel": "SMIOT_APP_HTTP",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "verb",
            "value": "POST"
          },
          {
            "name": "url",
            "value": "https://13-238-30-218.sslip.io/api/integrations/datadog/notification"
          },
          {
            "name": "requestHeaders",
            "value": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": [
                  "application/json"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "body",
            "value": "{\"event_id\":\"{{InstanceId}}\",\"workflow_name\":\"{{WorkflowName}}\",\"workflow_id\":\"{{WorkflowId}}\",\"message\":\"Aggregate PLC trip/ACK signals are candidates only; match exact scenario_run_id and command_id in Mongo before confirming incident. Workflow is read-only and does not claim recovery.\",\"category\":\"datadog\",\"severity\":\"warning\"}"
          }
        ],
        "readinessGate": {
          "thresholdType": "ANY"
        }
      }
    ],
    "handle": "smiot-w01-plc-safety-trip",
    "triggers": [
      {
        "startStepNames": [
          "read_operational_signals"
        ],
        "monitorTrigger": {
          "rateLimit": {
            "count": 1,
            "interval": "300s"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "startStepNames": [
          "read_operational_signals"
        ],
        "apiTrigger": {}
      }
    ],
    "connectionEnvs": [
      {
        "env": "default",
        "connections": [
          {
            "connectionId": "0e1ab54b-a758-47ad-ab39-c9ab4e091dba",
            "label": "SMIOT_APP_HTTP"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
